SUMMARY:GKP — call #2
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: GULF KEYSTONE PETROLEUM LTD (GKP)\n\nDeal context:\nGulf Keystone 
 Petroleum Ltd (GKP)\, a London Stock Exchange and Euronext Growth Oslo-lis
 ted oil producer operating the Shaikan Field in the Kurdistan Region of Ir
 aq\, is launching a USD-denominated senior unsecured bond with an initial 
 issue amount of USD 175 million and a maximum issue amount of USD 300 mill
 ion (plus any Additional Bonds from a ShaMaran Rollover)\, with a 5-year t
 enor and bullet maturity. The bond is structured to become senior secured 
 from the Security Take-Up Date\, pari passu with the ShaMaran Bond\, and f
 eatures a make-whole call for the first 30 months followed by a declining 
 premium call schedule\, with proceeds earmarked for near-term Shaikan Fiel
 d capex and general corporate purposes. The deal is at the Mandate stage\,
  with investor roadshow calls scheduled for October 23 and 26\, 2026\, and
  1-on-1 meetings available from October 22\, 2026\; the coupon rate remain
 s to be determined.
